{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Steel Angel Kurumi Zero","Sometime in the distant future, Kurumi, Saki and Karinka share an apartment with another girl named Excelia. One day, after school, Kurumi tells everyone that she is in love with a man she met named Michihito Kagura, but she doesn't know when she will see him again.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["鋼鉄天使くるみ零",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":554,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":555,"relation":"prequel"}],"id":"mal-556","ids":{"shikimori":556,"mal":556,"anilist":556,"kodik":"serial-28228"},"kodikIds":["serial-28228"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-28228":"2020-08-01T00:27:30Z"},"title":"Стальной ангел Куруми: Зеро","originalTitle":"Koutetsu Tenshi Kurumi Zero","alt":"Стальной ангел Куруми (ОВА-2) Steel Angel Kurumi Zero 鋼鉄天使くるみ零","description":"Когда-нибудь в далеком будущем Куруми, Саки и Каринка будут жить в одной квартире с другой девушкой по имени Экселия. Однажды, после школы, Куруми рассказывает всем, что влюблена в мужчину по имени Митихито Кагура, которого она встретила, но она не знает, когда увидит его снова.","year":2001,"type":"OVA","genres":["Драма","Романтика","Фантастика"],"rating":6.07,"popularity":1442,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[554,555],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/556/66b237681e541b2dbdab9512ed187c62.jpeg","width":365,"height":525},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/4b23c8e4767114e78de79f66e187b025ac0feff1.jpg","width":640,"height":480}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":2,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-1383","dubId":"1383","label":"San-tyan","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-28228","translationId":"1383","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/696562/e790f6c03cb4f80ffd6ef0b02784a3e2/720p","season":2,"ordina